    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444090/extras/3cb2dd7beebccc58c313db60ebc403cc.avif?t=1755115079\" width=115 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>March to the Heart</i></strong>\u00a0is a Risk-like roguelike adapting the iconic area control tactics game with deckbuilding: instead of mostly rolling dice,\u00a0<u>cards are played on territories</u>\u00a0to achieve tactical success. Build a deck which can tackle the varied  tactical challenges lying between you and the heart of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Card-driven territory-based combat, in a roguelike format</i></strong>. Cards replace the RNG of dice \u2014 with each play through requiring insight and optimization as you drive your immune system faction deeper towards the heart of the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444090/extras/05dfbc757a799677631fda8acbd59e8b.poster.avif?t=1755115079\" width=800 height=483 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444090/extras/05dfbc757a799677631fda8acbd59e8b.webm?t=1755115079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Territory Control</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build factories in your territories to defeat your foes, or be an ever shifting scavengers wearing down your opponent. A rich set of tactics are possible, all grounded in turn-based, territorial, combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt and Overcome</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from four distinct factions, each with unique decks and playstyles. Face evolving enemies with unpredictable tactics. No two runs are the same\u2014each journey brings new challenges and discoveries as you march toward the heart to safe the world from a total collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit, Collect, Remember</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden outposts and gather survivors to strengthen your forces. Find strange relics and forgotten artifacts that grant powerful new abilities\u2014and stir memories of what\u2019s at stake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444090/extras/dba3a070689585afee25753e435be3dd.poster.avif?t=1755115079\" width=800 height=483 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444090/extras/dba3a070689585afee25753e435be3dd.webm?t=1755115079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>For Roguelike Minds and Tactical Hearts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re a fan of roguelike deckbuilders, turn-based tactics, or just love an immersive sci-fi world full of hidden secrets, then <i>March to the Heart</i> is the game for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444090/extras/dee9b7ac73f767ec166ff7c8bf1adca3.avif?t=1755115079\" data-has-big width=800 height=821 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444090/extras/3cb2dd7beebccc58c313db60ebc403cc.avif?t=1755115079\" width=115 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>March to the Heart</i></strong>\u00a0is a Risk-like roguelike adapting the iconic area control tactics game with deckbuilding: instead of mostly rolling dice,\u00a0<u>cards are played on territories</u>\u00a0to achieve tactical success. Build a deck which can tackle the varied  tactical challenges lying between you and the heart of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Card-driven territory-based combat, in a roguelike format</i></strong>. Cards replace the RNG of dice \u2014 with each play through requiring insight and optimization as you drive your immune system faction deeper towards the heart of the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444090/extras/05dfbc757a799677631fda8acbd59e8b.poster.avif?t=1755115079\" width=800 height=483 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444090/extras/05dfbc757a799677631fda8acbd59e8b.webm?t=1755115079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Territory Control</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build factories in your territories to defeat your foes, or be an ever shifting scavengers wearing down your opponent. A rich set of tactics are possible, all grounded in turn-based, territorial, combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt and Overcome</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from four distinct factions, each with unique decks and playstyles. Face evolving enemies with unpredictable tactics. No two runs are the same\u2014each journey brings new challenges and discoveries as you march toward the heart to safe the world from a total collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit, Collect, Remember</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden outposts and gather survivors to strengthen your forces. Find strange relics and forgotten artifacts that grant powerful new abilities\u2014and stir memories of what\u2019s at stake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444090/extras/dba3a070689585afee25753e435be3dd.poster.avif?t=1755115079\" width=800 height=483 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444090/extras/dba3a070689585afee25753e435be3dd.webm?t=1755115079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>For Roguelike Minds and Tactical Hearts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re a fan of roguelike deckbuilders, turn-based tactics, or just love an immersive sci-fi world full of hidden secrets, then <i>March to the Heart</i> is the game for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444090/extras/dee9b7ac73f767ec166ff7c8bf1adca3.avif?t=1755115079\" data-has-big width=800 height=821 /></span></p>",
